          "At 1440px the sections appear in the design's order with four property cards per row, three company cards and four office cards.",
          "The hero search: choosing بيع / ايجار / بدل, one or more governorates, areas (the panel lists the areas of the chosen governorates, and asks for a governorate first when none is chosen), types and a price range, then pressing تصفية البحث opens /properties with those choices in the URL, several values joined by commas.",
          "A field with one choice shows its name, with several shows the label and the count (المحافظة (2)), and a price shows the range; مسح الكل empties that field only. Unpicking a governorate drops its areas. A panel closes on a click outside it or Escape.",
          "خدمات > شركات shows المحافظة, المنطقة, التخصص and نوع الخدمة and opens /companies with location, specialty and category; خدمات > مكاتب عقارية shows المحافظة and المنطقة only and opens /offices with location.",
          "اجراءات opens a menu of three rows, each with its round icon; every row opens the sign-in dialog.",
