          "Each applied governorate, area, category, year and price bound has a chip; pressing its × removes just that filter (removing a governorate also removes its areas); مسح الكل removes them all but keeps the listing type, the order and the view; the count beside the chips matches the results. With no filter applied the row is absent.",
          "With البدل chosen, الفئة lists only أرض and بيت and a السنة section appears; a category from another type and the years are dropped when the type changes; a year that is not four digits clears that filter.",
