          "الترتيب حسب reorders the results and shows the chosen order on the button; صورة / قائمة switches between photo cards and compact cards (title, price, place and size, income or years, advertiser); both stay in the URL through paging and filter changes.",
          "Pages are numbered 01, 02 … with the last page after an ellipsis; the current page is filled; the arrows step one page and are dimmed at the ends; every page link keeps the filters, order and view.",
          "On a phone the sidebar folds under 'التصفية حسب' with the number of applied filters, and opens when pressed.",
